# The tree grew a mix of CRLF and LF inside individual files - styles.css alone
# had ~3100 CRLF lines and ~470 LF ones - which makes diffs noisy and hides real
# changes. Normalise to LF in the repository; the working tree still follows the
# platform (core.autocrlf), so nothing changes for editors on Windows.
#
# Existing files convert the next time each one is committed. To do the whole
# tree in one commit instead: `git add --renormalize .`
* text=auto

*.js    text
*.json  text
*.css   text
*.html  text
*.md    text
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.yml   text
*.cmd   text eol=crlf

*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.webp  binary
*.woff2 binary
